# Zvec / RocksDB collection files and experiment artefacts must be stored
# byte-for-byte. With core.autocrlf=true (Git for Windows default) git
# rewrote RocksDB "CURRENT" / "OPTIONS" files to CRLF on checkout, and Zvec
# then refused to open them ("CURRENT file corrupted").  Mark these trees as
# binary so a clone on any OS gets usable collections.
backups/** -text
data/** -text
